OL,3,GNEWSAFirst storm of season brings day
OL,4,Aof disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes were left without
OL,7,Fpower, trains cancelled and schools
OL,8,Fshut as Storm Austen hit the South West
OL,9,Fand Channel Islands.
OL,11,FA red weather warning for wind was
OL,12,Fissued for the Channel Islands, with
OL,13,Fgusts of 84mph (135km/h) recorded at
OL,14,FJersey Airport just before 06:00 BST.
OL,15,FGusts of 76mph were recorded in the
OL,16,FIsles of Scilly.
OL,18,FIn Cornwall highway teams responded to
OL,19,Fabout 250 emergencies, including 150
OL,20,Freports of fallen trees, while similar
OL,21,Fissues also arose in Devon.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
